# Base44 sandbox defaults for ASTR.
#
# Loaded FIRST by docker-compose.base44.yml, so any value with the same name in
# /run/base44/app.env (the Base44 secrets) wins. Keep real credentials out of
# this file — it only holds values that are safe to commit.
#
# ASTR keeps all of its data in an external Supabase project, so this file is
# what tells the app which project to read.
#
# The repository's committed .env points at the older project
# nzayozxwyasvcroshddy (the one the live Lovable site was built against), while
# the SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY configured in Base44 belongs to
# kkwgbjovbcbzsvbhcyhq — the project holding ASTR's current data (today's health
# checks, this week's trades). The sandbox therefore talks to that one.
# Setting SUPABASE_URL as a Base44 secret overrides this line.
SUPABASE_URL=https://kkwgbjovbcbzsvbhcyhq.supabase.co
